["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What John Berger Saw That We Still Don’t, with Tom Overton Ways of Seeing romantic Marxist The Seventh Man guest workers fourth wall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-iq2-档案越是庞大-传记越无法中立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3caf1589a8bc137-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">42:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>伯格檔案越全越要懷疑：家是兩條軸線的交點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯格留下的不是結論，而是一套觀看機制：檔案越全越要懷疑，家是兩條軸線的交點，反殖民立場一生未變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文化批評</span><span class=\"tag\">觀看之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"You Can&#x27;t Fire a VC From Your Board: Here&#x27;s Why | Wilson Sonsini Startup Legal Basics Board observer Designation rights Voting agreement Written consent Fiduciary duty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-twist-投资人董事请神容易送神难-普通股永远无权罢免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aeca85f82817864a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>投資人董事請神容易送神難：普通股永遠無權罷免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投資人董事席位只由對應類別股選出，創始人持有的普通股沒有投票權把它換掉；唯一現實的路徑是私下勸退，或等對方自願降為董事會觀察員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">董事會</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Physics Reason AI Works When It Shouldn’t renormalization group critical exponent data collapse horizontal gene transfer ridge regression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-intotheimpossi-ai-有效是因为它发生了相变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7133e1b0fe88d6bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 沒塌縮是因為發生了相變，不是參數更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理學家 Nigel Goldenfeld 用重正化群和相變解釋 AI 在萬億參數下仍沒塌縮的機制，並把同一套框架用於回答遺傳密碼為何唯一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">相變</span><span class=\"tag\">重正化群</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"First Benchmark Results on an OpenAI GPU speculative decoding multi-token prediction (MTP) time to last token (TTLT) MXFP4 scale-up / scale-out domain Tomahawk 6\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-自研芯片百倍领先-基准选择与商业筹码才是关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fba1bec187512ffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 自研芯片領先百倍？那是自選基準加專用棧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 首顆自研芯片 Jalapeno 在自選基準上把 GB200 甩開 100 倍，但那是專用芯片、專用模型、專用軟件棧的結果；真正的護城河是系統集成和定價權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片設計</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"具身智能的“山寨機時代”：親歷2026世界機器人大會，我們的48個觀察-Vol 104 VLA ODM UWB Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn768a8a-具身智能的山寨机时代-没人赚钱但18家互投/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac5fc3c22c8141af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"腦\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">腦放電波</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>機器人大會48個觀察：沒人賺錢，18家卻互投36筆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026世界機器人大會的48個觀察：機器人拼裝化、真demo出現、定語通脹；行業沒人賺錢，卻有18家企業投資36筆，本體成本三年降十倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dylan Patel – Anthropic &amp; OpenAI will have most of the world’s compute by 2028 FLOP RSI hyperscaler crowding-out effect continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-dwarkesh-2028-年前两家实验室将控制全球大部分算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59e51ac2f0c2b285-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>算力正以每年數倍速度向兩家實驗室集中，2028 年它們將控制全球大部分算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算力正以每年數倍速度向 Anthropic 和 OpenAI 集中，到 2028 年它們將控制全球大部分有效算力，並可能把算力價格推到每兆瓦 5000 萬美元，進而引發主權債務危機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">實驗室經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Return to the Chamber of Mysteries EMC Slot antenna Grounded coplanar waveguide QSFP cage Line (EMC chamber)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-oxide-emc-合规是玄学吗-一次机架级辐射超标排障记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b5eb6a03ee5e8af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>機架輻射超標兩輪無解，解法藏在一場無關會議裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機架後側 26.565GHz 輻射超標，排查兩輪無果，最終靠一場無關會議上的論文找到解法：在連接器上加吸波材料。這不是玄學，是高頻物理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">EMC</span><span class=\"tag\">硬件工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The New Economics of AI | Martin Casado &amp; Steven Sinofsky Foom TAM in-distribution Mythical man-month expert systems\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-a16z-ai-正在把工程问题变成资本问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 把軟件業從工程約束變成資本約束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Martin Casado 與 Steven Sinofsky 的核心判斷：AI 把軟件業從工程約束變成資本約束——20 人的團隊也能有效花掉 10 億美元，創業公司因此能和巨頭同場競爭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">資本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Future of AI in the Workplace | Special Episode (Mike Sullivan and Vinay Gidwaney) work genome reducible / irreducible workforce intelligence score amplification score intelligence lock-in PIP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-rationalreminder-ai-时代该由-hr-主导-不是-it-把-ai-当员工雇进来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b9befd958d3d16f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代該由 HR 主導，不是 IT：把 AI 當員工僱進來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 當技術採購交給 IT，是把主菜當配菜；真正要拆的是任務而不是崗位，該主導這件事的是 HR，因為 AI 沒有感受，而人需要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">組織變革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"495 陸大鵬談莎士比亞戲劇與英國歷史的互相影響 intertextuality\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-cn2aa250-莎士比亚历史剧是都铎王朝的宣传工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>莎士比亞歷史劇是都鐸王朝的宣傳工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎翁歷史劇歪曲史實極多，本質是都鐸王朝的政治宣傳：醜化理查三世、迴避亨利八世敏感話題，從而鞏固本朝合法性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亞</span><span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"This Is Why People Hate the Government time tax ordeal mechanism improper payment only-once policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ezra-时间税-行政羞辱是穷人恨政府的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>行政羞辱是窮人恨政府的原因：福利申請像一場時間稅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府福利項目中的行政負擔不是效率問題，而是社會控制工具：它用羞辱和文書懲罰窮人，把進步政策變成篩選少數人的漏斗，最終讓受益者恨上政府。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福利制度</span><span class=\"tag\">行政負擔</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Back by Popular Demand: How to support your child&#x27;s secure attachment even if you didn&#x27;t grow up with it with Dr. Miriam Steele Strange Situation Adult Attachment Interview reflective functioning good enough mother still face\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-secureattach-童年逆境不必传给孩子-会讲自己的故事就能打断代际循环/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>童年逆境不必傳給孩子：會講自己的故事就能打斷代際循環</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">倫敦親子項目發現，父母能否用連貫、靈活的方式講述自己的童年，比童年本身好壞更能預測孩子是否安全依戀——反思功能是可訓練的技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依戀理論</span><span class=\"tag\">養育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Parallel’s Parag Agrawal: Building a New Web for AI Agents Shapley value grounding fresh index memory hierarchy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-trainingdata-人类点击数据是-bug-agent-搜索重建网络经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca134f7cdc5e5aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>人類點擊數據是 Bug：Agent 搜索要重做索引與定價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當搜索的客戶從人變成 Agent，點擊數據失效，索引、定價與商業模式都要重來；Parag 用質量/成本/延遲三角和 Shapley 給出新框架。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent 搜索</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Neil Movva - Making AI 10x Cheaper - [Invest Like the Best, EP.488] KV cache HBM SRAM Tensor Core Harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-ilt-推理成本需降3-6个数量级-后台任务才是主战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e8a839c878b0c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>後臺Agent將吃掉90%算力，推理優化該為吞吐犧牲延遲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI推理的下一波不在聊天而在後臺Agent，後者將吃掉90%算力。Sale Research為此優化吞吐而非延遲，甚至接受80%可用性，以換取價格降幾個數量級，並認為Nvidia每瓦優勢被高估。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"286: ENCORE: Getting into College with Rick Clark holistic review test-optional Common App FAFSA net price calculator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-asklisa-申请没有万能配方-美国大学录取的反焦虑真相/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">48:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>錄取沒有萬能配方：美國大學申請的反焦慮真相</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">低錄取率只是全國約 80 所名校的敘事；對多數家庭，錄取沒有公式，家長最有用的是固定會議和「控制可控項」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美本申請</span><span class=\"tag\">錄取率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Auschwitz: An SS officer’s photo album Solahütte Counterintelligence Corps Frankfurt Auschwitz Trials\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-witness-纳粹屠夫的私人相册-没有惨状只有蓝莓和假期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>納粹軍官相冊裡沒有暴行，只有藍莓和假期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一本 SS 軍官私人相冊記錄的並非暴行，而是度假、聚餐和摘藍莓；它證明屠殺者清楚自己在做什麼，也提醒我們理解大屠殺必須看向施害者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大屠殺</span><span class=\"tag\">納粹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"84.49 家央企採買進場，史上最熱WRC：泡沫被擠壓，具身行業進入實戰階段｜14 年從業者的行家鑑別指南 VLA World Model Teleoperation EMG Data Pipeline Post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-lightstar-两万台出货九成吃灰-具身行业进入算roi的实战期/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/adbddf5c93cfc63c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>兩萬臺出貨九成吃灰：具身行業進入算ROI的實戰期</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">WRC的熱浪之下，真正做預訓練的創業公司可能只有一兩家，真實落地需求可能只有出貨量的10%，行業已從秀demo進入算ROI的實戰階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Intel&#x27;s New CPU Finally Makes Sense Fan-out fabric architecture Compute building block Fabric hub UCIe Foveros 3D Direct\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-techtechpotato-下一代-xeon-把宝押在-1-2gb-末级缓存上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc7c90dc34e0b3f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">21:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>Intel 棄用 EMIB 改 UCIe：1.2GB 緩存堆出 256 核</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Diamond Rapids 預計 2027 年發布，最高 256 個 P-core、1.2GB 末級緩存、16 通道 DDR5；用可裁剪的 compute building block 和 UCIe 互連取代 EMIB，大緩存是它對抗 AI 時代的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CPU 架構</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Michael Kratsios: Trump&#x27;s Science Agenda, Anti-Science Claims, Fauci&#x27;s Damage, DEI &amp; China Eroom&#x27;s Law golden tickets RCP 8.5 GRFP Genesis Mission OSTP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-allin-美国科学不是缺钱-是花钱方式错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/527571f45bcd0e49-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>美國科學不是缺錢，是花錢方式錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NIH 預算從 1998 年 140 億漲到 2024 年 470 億，產出效率卻每 9 年腰斬一次。Kratsios 的答案是：問題不在預算數字，在撥款機制本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技政策</span><span class=\"tag\">科研撥款</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"95% of AI Agent Projects Fail to Reach Production. Here&#x27;s Why | Manoj Saxena, TrustWise runtime governance AI control tower guardian agents semantic action layer trust posture management\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-eyeonai-智能体流量首超人类-ai-失控才是落地最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b277eb062496b5a5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Eye On A.I.</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>95% 的 AI 智能體項目死在試點：缺的不是智能，是控制層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 已從內容生成走向自主行動：95% 的 agent 項目困在 pilot，進不了生產，因為缺的不是智能，而是運行時控制層。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Will Photonics Loosen the Bottlenecks in Neural Systems? WDM (Wavelength Division Multiplexing) Semiconductor Optical Amplifier (SOA) McCulloch-Pitts neuron model Indium Phosphide (InP) Femtojoule per operation TDM (Time Division Multiplexing)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-brainsandmachi-光子计算第三次浪潮-五年内走出实验室-先征服无人机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9151fd6dae1293cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">45:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brains and Machines</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>光子計算第三次浪潮：五年內走出實驗室，先征服無人機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光子不能像電子那樣相互作用，卻能用波長複用實現超大並行和超低延遲。全光學神經網絡五年內有望落地，第一站不是服務器，而是無人機和實時控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">光子計算</span><span class=\"tag\">神經形態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Has the Solid State Transformer’s Time Finally Come? Solid State Transformer (SST) IGBT Silicon Carbide (SiC) Galvanic isolation 800VDC architecture PETT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-asianometry-固态变压器吹了五十年-ai数据中心是第一个真买家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a4d5049243d5f237-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>固態變壓器吹了五十年，AI數據中心是第一個真買家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">固態變壓器在海軍、高鐵、智能電網裡試了三次都沒成，因為它只是「更小」,而AI數據中心的銅線和800伏直流問題第一次給了它必須存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電力電子</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心供電</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"317. Plot Twist: The Second Story Hiding Inside Every Great Pitch pitch gatekeeper auteur\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-thinkfast-好提案藏着两个故事-你的故事和对方升职的故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fd7a03d438b4365-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>提案要講兩個故事：一個是項目，一個是對方升職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">好萊塢編劇 Rhett Reese 揭示提案的本質：表面講項目故事，暗線講對方成功的故事。把對方當主角，降低風險、放大回報，提案成功率大增。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">提案技巧</span><span class=\"tag\">溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"365 | Vitor Cardoso on Why Black Holes Are Special no-hair theorem Kerr metric light ring cosmic censorship matched filtering last parsec problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-24-mindscape-黑洞只有两个参数-形成机制却仍是谜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0824</span></div>\n<h2>黑洞只有兩個參數，形成機制卻仍是謎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">引力波與 EHT 確認黑洞確實只有兩個參數，但 120 倍太陽質量的黑洞如何形成、暗物質是否由微型黑洞構成、最後 1 秒差距如何跨越，都是未解之謎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黑洞</span><span class=\"tag\">引力波</span>\n</div></div></a>"]